---
// Philosophy - Manifesto style
---

<section class="philosophy chapter-section" id="philosophy">
  <div class="container">

    <p class="section-eyebrow" data-reveal>Belief</p>

    <blockquote class="manifesto-quote" data-reveal="clip" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
      "The future isn't about better screens.<br class="br-lg"/>
      It's about <em data-text="BETTER DECISIONS.">better decisions.</em>"
    </blockquote>

    <div class="phil-body" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
      <div class="phil-left">
        <p class="phil-context">
          The shift happening in product design isn't aesthetic - it's structural.
          AI is moving from a feature to an operating layer. That changes what
          a designer's job actually is.
        </p>
        <p class="phil-context">
          I design toward systems that anticipate, clarify, and scale - not just
          systems that look good in a presentation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="phil-right">
        <ul class="principles">
          <li class="principle">
            <span class="pr-num">01</span>
            <span class="pr-text">Anticipate friction before it reaches the user</span>
          </li>
          <li class="principle">
            <span class="pr-num">02</span>
            <span class="pr-text">Clarify who holds authority at each decision point</span>
          </li>
          <li class="principle">
            <span class="pr-num">03</span>
            <span class="pr-text">Design for scale, not just the happy path</span>
          </li>
          <li class="principle">
            <span class="pr-num">04</span>
            <span class="pr-text">Integrate AI as structure, not decoration</span>
          </li>
          <li class="principle">
            <span class="pr-num">05</span>
            <span class="pr-text">Build systems that outlast the brief</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 9rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 88px;
    padding: 24px 0 24px 24px;
    border: none;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.12);
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Corner marks on the quote */
  .manifesto-quote::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.2);
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.2);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .manifesto-quote em {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-style: normal;
    position: relative;
  }



  .br-lg { display: block; }

  .phil-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .phil-context {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.2vw, 1.05rem);
    color: rgba(242, 237, 227, 0.5);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  /*  Principles  */
  .principles {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .principle {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.08);
    transition: all 0s steps(1);
    cursor: default;
  }

  .principle:first-child { border-top: 1px solid rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.08); }
  .principle:hover { padding-left: 6px; background: rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.03); }
  .principle:hover .pr-text { color: var(--text); }

  .pr-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 40px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .pr-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(242, 237, 227, 0.55);
    line-height: 1.5;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .phil-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .br-lg { display: none; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .manifesto-quote { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 7vw, 2.5rem); margin-bottom: 40px; }
  }
</style>

<style>
  /* Keep the manifesto as the visual event; remove competing background type. */
  .philosophy::after { display: none; }
  .manifesto-quote::before,

  .phil-body { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
</style>